0321-negroni-wlan-ce: Wi-Fi level 8 (negroniwlan=8), copy engines on HAL SRNG, polled, steps 27-28.
New bsd/dev/negroni_wlan_ce.c: one 304 KiB DMA area (pointer area, CE0/CE3 source rings, CE1/CE2
destination + status rings, 2048-byte buffers, NC alias), ring registers through the BAR0 window (0x310c,
ath11k pci.c:75-128), SRNG hw init without MSI (hal.c:268/:347), host pointers through the shadow registers,
RX post / poll / TX send / reap (ce.c), read-back proof of the CE0 base; step 28 waits for HTC READY.
Details: patches/xnu/README-wifi.md "0321".

